{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2023-02-27 10:00:00', 'title': 'CBOE DIGITAL SELECTED AS DMIST AMBASSADOR BY FIA', 'text': 'CHICAGO , FEB. 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE DIGITAL IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE IT HAS JOINED THE DERIVATIVES MARKET INSTITUTE FOR STANDARDS, INC. (DMIST) AS AN AMBASSADOR. SUPPORTED BY THE FUTURES INDUSTRY ASSOCIATION (FIA), DMIST IS AN INDUSTRY-GOVERNED STANDARDS BODY FOCUSED ON IMPROVING THE EFFICIENCY, RESILIENCY, COMPETITIVENESS AND INNOVATIVENESS OF THE EXCHANGE-TRADED AND CLEARED DERIVATIVES MARKETS.'}